tools/package-bobber-tally.py, including copies in official add-on packages.
Websites, forums, desktop and mobile clients, Xiaohongshu tools and assets,
and all other repository paths are outside this grant. Public access alone
is not a license.

"Modified versions" include adaptations, translations, ports, and excerpts
containing protected expression. "Distribution" includes providing source,
packages, bundles, or modified versions to others. This license creates no
new exclusive rights in facts, ideas, API knowledge, or independent work.

"Commercial use" means use, copying, modification, or distribution intended
to obtain commercial advantage, monetary compensation, or other economic
consideration, or to support the operations, products, or services of a
for-profit business. Purpose governs regardless of the user's legal form.
Free access, lack of profit, or a "study only" label is not determinative.

